======TP-Link TL-WDR3600 (N600)======
TP-Link TL-WDR3600 is 802.11n Dual Band (concurrent) and Gigabit Ethernet.
Advertised as 600 Mbps it is Dual-Stream (2x2) on the 2.4 GHz Band and Dual-Stream (2x2) on the 5 GHz Band. This wiki entry is fairly brief, but most things in the [[tl-wdr4300_v1|TP-Link TL-WDR4300]] wiki entry apply here.

{{:media:tplink:tl-wdr3600:tl-wdr3600_2.jpg?direct&400|}}

